# AI workspace folders stay local: the λPrize submission check rejects a repo
# that contains any of them (lambda-prize .github/scripts/validate-submission.sh).
# The Logos AI skills in .claude/skills are copied from refs/tooling/logos-ai-skills
# and have no upstream licence, so they must never be committed either.
.claude/
.cursor/
.aider/
.copilot/
.windsurf/
.bolt/

